WEBVTT

40:31.080 --> 40:33.499
(WIND ROARING)

40:39.171 --> 40:43.467
BENJEN: I wanted to be here
when you saw it for the first time.

40:51.726 --> 40:54.937
- I'm leaving this morning.
- You're leaving?

40:56.063 --> 40:58.232
I'm the First Ranger.

40:58.357 --> 41:00.693
My job is out there.
